# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PARTICIPANT DATA — NEVER COMMITTED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/ holds CALM participant data: per-subject connectomes keyed by CALM ID,
# and a behavioural datasheet carrying special-category health data (clinical
# diagnoses, medication status, gender, age in months, IQ percentiles) for 315
# children. It stays on /imaging, inside CBU's governance framework, and is
# regenerable by anyone with cluster access:
#
#     env/bin/python scripts/export_calm800_schaefer100x17.py
#
# Do not add exceptions to this rule without the CALM data manager's sign-off.
data/

# Any stray participant-level files, wherever they land
*.mat
sub-*.csv
*datasheet*
*phenotype*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment (1.7 GB; rebuild with scripts/setup_env.sh)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
env/
scripts/setup_env.log
scripts/get-pip.py

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / notebook noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.virtual_documents/
*.egg-info/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Cluster-specific paths to the raw data (see local_paths.example.py)
local_paths.py
